  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capacity building of industry associations serving engineering companies in Kazakhstan and Uzbekistan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the present project is to improve services offered by industry associations (further Business intermediate organization  BIOs) to engineering companies in Kazakhstan and Uzbekistan, and to introduce certification for engineers to assure high quality standards in investment project implementation and develop MSMEs presence in new areas.</narrative>
  </description>
